{"id":105478,"vol":{"id":18017,"name":"Annihilation: Nova"},"num":"4","name":"Ten Minutes and Counting","title":"Annihilation: Nova #4","year":"2006","date":"2006-09-30","store":"2006-07-19","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/1076/82138-18017-105478-1-annihilation-nova.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/1076/82138-18017-105478-1-annihilation-nova.jpg","pub":"Marvel","deck":"","desc":"Driven to regain his dignity and burdened by the fate of Xandar, Nova faces the Annihilation Wave head on and unleashes the full power of the Nova Force! But is that enough against such a vast force of cosmic destruction? And if it isn't, who will stand with him in that last battle? Quasar? Drax?\n\nAnnihilus kills Quasar but Nova, Drax and Cammi escape.\n\nNova and Quasar attack Annihilus's command ship to allow the refuges escape. Annihilus kills Quasar and takes possession of the Quatum Bands. Nova, with the Worldmind, provide Annihilus with his first defeat.","people":[{"id":7874,"name":"Andy Lanning","role":"writer"},{"id":41783,"name":"Andy Schmidt","role":"editor"},{"id":42410,"name":"Aubrey Sitterson","role":"editor"},{"id":6119,"name":"Brian Reber","role":"colorist"},{"id":41781,"name":"Cory Petit","role":"letterer"},{"id":41686,"name":"Dan Abnett","role":"writer"},{"id":41596,"name":"Dan Buckley","role":"other"},{"id":41850,"name":"Gabriele Dell'Otto","role":"cover"},{"id":1537,"name":"Joe Quesada","role":"editor"},{"id":43502,"name":"Kevin Walker","role":"penciler"},{"id":41683,"name":"Molly Lazer","role":"editor"},{"id":13232,"name":"Rick Magyar","role":"inker"}],"chars":[{"id":2105,"name":"Nova","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/9929763-large-5066211.jpg"},{"id":6807,"name":"Drax the Destroyer","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/3/31666/4529800-drax-19b77.jpg"},{"id":3319,"name":"Quasar","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11119/111198274/7237057-32188461_282939552461541_3208543760719806464_n.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":41287,"name":"\"Marvel Cosmic\" Annihilation"}]}